{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1102221-enlivenening-a-ghost","id":1102221,"title":"Enlivenening a Ghost","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-10T02:31:43-07:00","id":1102221,"title":"Enlivenening a Ghost","content":"So, ghosts are the spirits of the dead stuck in the dark umbra. full of death, cold an decay. <br /> <br /> However, some human spirits also reach afterlives in middle and high umbra. Or are just born/created there. <br /> <br /> So, how do you think a mage would go about enlivening a ghost to move it to the middle/high umbra? Reweaving the pattern with spirit or prime, feeding it appropriate quintessence, just bodily dragging to the middle umbra, dipping into Wyrd energy, etc?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T03:08:40-07:00","id":1102224,"title":"","content":"Help it transcend while having a paradigm which will make that work.<br /> <br /> For a Wraith to transcend, they have to deal with their shadow, remove their earthly anchors, absolve their passions, and empower their &quot;higher self&quot; (the eiodolan).<br /> <br /> If the mage is a Euthanatos or other that believe in reincarnation, their influence will allow the wraith to reincarnate. If the mage is a Dreamspeaker or similar, it will allow their spirit to return to the spirit world where they may join the Earth Mother or whichever.<br /> <br /> If the mage if a Choristor or simply monotheistic, their help will allow the Wraith to ascend to the Afterworlds.<br /> <br /> If the mage is Hermetic, or has similar beliefs of physical laws, the wraith will ascend to the Astral Realm where it will become a spirit within the courts there depending on what the Wraith's Eidolon is all about, and how many people in the psychical world regard them.<br /> <br /> If the mage is an Etherite who has a theory on dreams, or some other mage that believes in the world of the fae, perhaps the Wraith unbound by its shadow and the phsyical becomes the very best of what it was, a memory of the collected conciousness now fulling embraced by The Dreaming (or the Maya)<br /> <br /> If the mage is a Hollow One, Transcendence stops the Wraith existing. That's it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T03:20:06-07:00","id":1102225,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I understand that. What I want is to turn the ghost into a spirit without send it to afterlife or reincarnation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T04:17:39-07:00","id":1102229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Warpwind</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1102221-enlivenening-a-ghost?p=1102225#post1102225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I understand that. What I want is to turn the ghost into a spirit without send it to afterlife or reincarnation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then you'll need both believe it's possible, and have help from the Spirit world denizens. (whether that be the pantheon of angels, the elemental courts, the Olympians, or whoever in the High Umbra, or Gaia, the Fates, Luna, or whoever in the Middle Umbra)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T07:55:29-07:00","id":1102268,"title":"","content":"You're going to have to wing it and make it up. The rules don't really speak to it.<br /> <br /> If you put a wraith in a box, take that box to the Middle Umbra, fill it full of Gnosis, marinate, let the ghost out, what have you got? (Assume you have all the relevant Spheres to do that sort of thing).<br /> <br /> If a player did something like that in one of my games (and, I guess, they have in some sorts of ways), I would definitely allow <i>something </i>interesting to happen.<br /> <br /> In fact, who knows what will happen if you just take a wraith from the Shadowlands and just release it into the wilds of the Middle Umbra? Does it evaporate from all that LIFE? Does it swell up like a balloon and pop because of all the primal energy a la emotion? Does it just operate as per normal but reeks of the Wyrm so is going to have issues unless it finds a Blight? (And does that mean that you get a mutant &quot;fomori&quot; wraith or does that just feed it's Shadow to the point it specter's out?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1062,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","user":"Ajax","date":". 06-10-2017, 10:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T10:40:37-07:00","id":1102296,"title":"","content":"Exactly! F*** if I knew what would happen, so hit me with what ideas you got!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"